			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event3_react_hero_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『もう　すきにして……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『もう　好きにして……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event3_react_enemy_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ジュジュベ『あら　よわきだこと▼
さいきん　もんだいの
むきりょくって　やつじゃない？▽
じゃ　えんりょなく　いくわね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ジュジュベ『あら　弱気だこと▼
最近　問題の
無気力って　やつじゃない？▽
じゃ　遠慮なく　行くわね！</Text>
